From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:35:23 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 347/443] [ae-patch] Voice mode shows its state: a voice sheet
 on phones, a voice bar on the desktop, and refused playback says so

Voice mode kept its state in a small word beside the speaker button that
hid on narrow screens, and iOS silently refused replies no tap had started.
A panel now shows listening, working, speaking and blocked, with a live mic
level and the sentence being spoken. Playback is primed inside the tap, and
a refused reply offers a tap that plays it instead of falling back silently.
